* Strong business acumen, market intelligence, able to translate data and information into meaningful business insights and clear recommendations
* Strong analytical, sales/account planning, problem solving and critical thinking skills
* Self\-motivated individual who is customer\-focused and results\-oriented
* Self\-driven, seeks continuous improvement and proactively thinks ahead
* Excellent command of Vietnamese and English (i.e., written and spoken)


