* Apple prioritizes integrity, honesty, and accountability in all its products and business practices. You’re a trusted advisor who upholds Apple’s values and ensures its best interests are served.
* You deeply understand customer needs, challenges, and concerns, enabling you to exceed customer expectations. You connect and influence the right people, both inside and outside Apple, to address unique customer and partner needs. As a go\-to person with leadership, you’re comfortable in tough situations, settling disputes, negotiating, and making difficult decisions. You view conflicts as opportunities for growth.
* Experience in engaging with Government developing shared vision of use of technology as well as support procurement processes.
* Communication is crucial to Apple’s success. You actively engage with customers and peers, exploring endless possibilities. You recognize perspectives, patiently listen to details, and commit to what’s right to drive innovation.
