 • Build and maintain a healthy pipeline of Marketing Qualified Leads (MQLs) and Sales Qualified Leads (SQLs) in HubSpot.
 



 • Collaborate with Marketing to align on target personas, campaign messaging, and lead scoring criteria.
 



  





