 If you’re looking to lead digital transformation through intelligent software, we’re ready to build with you.
   

  

 Let’s create the future – together.
   

  

 Role Overview
   

  

 We are looking for a
 **highly motivated Intern – AI Automation QA Solution Engineer** 
 to join our Solution Architecture team.
   

  

 This role is designed for candidates who are passionate about
 **software quality engineering, test automation, and applying AI to improve testing efficiency and reliability** 
 . You will work closely with Solution Architects, QA Engineers, and Pre\-Sales teams to
 **design, prototype, and demonstrate AI\-powered automation testing solutions** 
 for enterprise clients.
   

  

 This internship is a
 **clear pathway to becoming an Automation QA Engineer or AI Solution Engineer** 
 .
   

  

 Key Responsibilities
   

  

* Pre\-Sales \& Solution Support (QA\-Focused)
* Support Solution Architects in analyzing client quality challenges, test automation needs, and non\-functional requirements.
* Assist in preparing technical solution proposals, demos, and PoCs focused on automation QA and AI\-assisted testing.
* Help showcase how AI can improve test coverage, test generation, defect detection, and maintenance cost reduction.
* AI\-Driven Automation QA Development
* Design and implement test automation frameworks (UI, API, and integration tests) using modern tools.
* Apply AI/LLM capabilities to QA use cases such as:
+ Automated test case generation from requirements or user stories
+ Intelligent test script creation and self\-healing tests
+ Test data generation using LLMs
+ AI\-assisted defect analysis and test optimization

* Collaborate with senior engineers to integrate AI\-powered QA solutions into CI/CD pipelines.
* Tooling, Integration \& Cloud Enablement
* Work with automation tools such as Playwright, Selenium, Cypress, or similar frameworks.
* Integrate automation tests with DevOps pipelines (Azure DevOps, GitHub Actions, Jenkins).
* Assist in deploying QA automation and AI services on cloud platforms (Azure preferred).
* Support integration of QA tools with enterprise systems (Jira, Test Management tools, CI/CD systems).
* Collaboration \& Continuous Learning
* Collaborate with developers, QA engineers, AI engineers, and pre\-sales teams in agile environments.
* Clearly communicate technical ideas, PoC results, and solution value in English.
* Continuously explore new AI trends in software testing and quality engineering and propose improvements.


**Requirements**
 Must\-Have
   

  

* Final\-year student or recent graduate in Computer Science, Software Engineering, AI, or related fields.
* Solid foundation in software testing concepts (functional testing, regression, automation basics).
* Hands\-on programming skills in Python and/or JavaScript/TypeScript.
* Basic experience or strong interest in test automation frameworks (Playwright, Selenium, Cypress, etc.).
* Understanding of AI/LLMs and their application in software engineering (e.g., OpenAI APIs, prompt engineering).
* Strong analytical mindset with the ability to translate business and quality problems into technical solutions.
* Proactive learner, self\-driven, and comfortable working in a fast\-paced environment.
* Good English communication skills (written and verbal).


 Nice\-to\-Have
   

  

* Experience with AI\-assisted testing, test generation, or QA automation PoCs.
* Familiarity with LangChain, OpenAI, Hugging Face, or similar LLM tooling.
* Knowledge of CI/CD pipelines, DevOps practices, or test reporting tools (Allure, ReportPortal).
* Exposure to cloud platforms (Azure, AWS, or GCP).
* Basic understanding of MLOps or AI lifecycle management.


**Benefits**
* Allowance: Up to 4,000,000 VND/month (Training contract: 2 months)
* Probation salary after training: Negotiable based on performance
* Clear career path toward Automation QA Engineer / AI Solution Engineer roles
* Young, dynamic, and professional working environment
* Opportunity to work with real enterprise clients and pre\-sales scenarios
* Exposure to the latest AI, automation, and DevOps technologies
* Training sponsorship (e.g., Udemy and technical courses)
* Potential onsite opportunities in Japan, Singapore, Australia
* Team\-building activities, summer vacation, birthday events, and mor


