 This role offers the opportunity to be part of a growing Consumer Healthcare business and represent trusted OTC and prescription brands in the pharmacy channel. The Sales Representative will gain strong exposure to both OTC and Rx selling, work closely with key pharmacy customers, and build a solid foundation for a long\-term career in healthcare sales within a reputable organization.
 



  





