* Manage a portfolio of customers and prospects, identifying opportunities to upsell and cross\-sell financial products and services
* Conduct outbound sales calls to engage with customers, understand their needs, and present tailored solutions
* Build and maintain relationships with customers, providing exceptional service and support to drive customer loyalty and retention
* Meet and exceed sales targets, while adhering to regulatory requirements and bank policies
* Collaborate with internal stakeholders to resolve customer issues and improve overall customer experience


