* Experience in international sales (preferably with markets in the USA, UK, Australia, Germany, etc.).
* Familiarity with international markets, understanding of import\-export processes, trade laws, and customs differences.
* Proficiency in English with strong skills in listening, speaking, reading, and writing (required).
* Proficient in basic IT skills and office software: Microsoft Word, Microsoft Excel, internet services, email, etc.
* Ability to work independently or as part of a team, presentable appearance, and good communication skills.
* Honest, enthusiastic, careful, dynamic, and responsible in work.
* Knowledge of international shipping and import\-export processes.
