* Salary from 20\-50 million VND, including sales bonuses, with total income up to 70 million VND/month.
* 13th, 14th, and 15th month salary bonuses (based on performance).
* ESOP stock options.
* Performance bonuses, team awards, domestic and international travel.
* Bonuses for holidays and company founding day (August 18 annually).
* Advanced/excellent employee awards ranging from 10\-15 million VND per person.
* Longevity bonuses up to nearly 2 million VND per person.
* Bonding bonus of 2 million VND per person.
* Innovation bonuses up to 50 million VND per improvement.
* Social insurance as per legal regulations, 24/7 accident insurance, life insurance, and medical care for management staff and high\-performing employees.
* Clear career progression from trainee, employee, specialist, team leader, deputy/manager to sales director.
* Annual staff trip with a value of 3 million VND per person.
* Scholarships for children of employees with excellent academic performance.
* Travel support for employees living far from home during the Lunar New Year.
