 We are looking for a black\-belt sales leader to accelerate our capability and performance. An engaging and collaborative leader, you energise those around you to achieve breakthrough growth. You are not phased by the ambiguities or complexities of forging new paths, rather you proactively evaluate, recommend and execute the appropriate choices to make things happen.
   

  

 With a strong foundation in commercial process and execution discipline, you drive rigor and discipline in our integrated commercial planning processes, how that translates into JBP and customer engagement plans and how that gets delivered through in\-year/quarter/month performance delivery processes and routines.
   

  

