 The Marketing Specialist will oversee localization, and encompasses traditional and innovative marketing approaches with the primary goal of increasing our reach and conversion within the local market by appropriate penetration in multi\-channel campaigns, including website user experience, SEO, digital/print collaterals, EDMs, social media, content marketing, and PR.
 



 The ideal candidate will possess advanced English language proficiency, a skill highly valued for effective translation and content adapted communication and campaign execution. They will demonstrate an ability to critically evaluate processes, ask thoughtful questions, and provide insightful suggestions that enhance overall team performance. A natural aptitude for quickly learning and adapting to new technologies with minimal training is essential, ensuring seamless integration into fast\-paced, dynamic environments. The ability to challenge conventional approaches constructively, combined with a proactive mindset, will add significant value to the team's strategic initiatives.
 



  





