* At least 6 years of experience in business development, partnerships, or account management, including 2–3 years in a managerial role.
* Experience leading and developing teams, driving performance and delivering measurable outcomes, building and scaling new projects.
* Track record in merchant acquisition and strategic partnerships with top/main accounts.
* With the ability to define growth strategies and complete.
* Work and manage complex projects.
* Comfortable with data analysis to identify opportunities and solve challenges.


