**The global talent roadmap you define will foster the growth and development of all learning experience team members, ultimately enhancing organizational effectiveness and global employee performance.**
**Key Responsibilities**
**The Global Senior Manager, Learning Experience will be responsible for, but not limited to, the following:**
* Strategic Program Leadership: Lead the strategic planning and execution for the design, delivery, and evaluation of comprehensive global learning programs. This includes leadership development, technical skills training, and onboarding initiatives across multiple geographies, supported by Local LX Geo Leaders.
