* Exposure to senior leadership and critical decisions You’ll work closely with leaders who care deeply about building the business well — not just growing fast.
* Room to grow with the company As Luxehouze scales, strong performers get broader scope, bigger problems, and leadership opportunities. Growth here is earned, not time\-based.


