 The AGM is responsible for the management, development and growth of an agreed portfolio of CBRE accounts, ensuring financial and operational commitments are met and exceeded. This includes P\&L oversight, QHSE, regulatory compliance, people and talent management, operations management, and business development. The AGM is responsible for recruiting, coaching and mentoring Contract Managers within their portfolio.
   

  

