 Certificates and/or Licenses
   

  

 FM or Leadership certification desirable.
   

  

 Key Skills and Characteristics
   

  

 Communication
   

  

 Excellent written and verbal communication skills. Strong organizational and analytical skills. Highly accessible and responsive.
   

  

