 Your role will be to support the development and execution of Business Development (BD) strategies that drive growth for Capital Markets, with a particular focus on DCM and also supporting FRG, ensuring alignment with the firm and Clients and Sectors strategies. You will identify opportunities using strong Capital Markets insights and data\-led intelligence, drive cross\-selling, execute client\-centric BD activities, strengthen client and internal stakeholder relationships, and inform the overall BD strategy to drive profitable revenue growth.
   

  

