* Develop a strong network across global BD teams and the Business Development \& Marketing (BDM) function to keep the local office connected to the global network and strategy, driving interconnectivity across these teams.
* Develop and execute focused Capital Markets and client growth plans, facilitating cross\-selling opportunities with wider global practice teams.
* Provide timely, high\-quality input into win strategies and market\-leading pitch and panel submissions for Capital Markets matters.
* Drive relationships with Client \& Sector BD teams to foster growth in relation to priority sectors and market opportunities, and create compelling, Capital Markets\-led go\-to\-market campaigns to engage target clients.
