+ Cell culture products and media
+ Flow cytometry instruments, antibodies, and reagents
+ Single‑cell and multi‑omics enabling tools (sample prep, immunology panels, cell sorting workflows)

* Conduct product demos, workshops, and seminars for scientific and clinical users.
