li-4395942303,"Account Manager, GrabAds Thailand",Grab,"Bangkok, Bangkok City, Thailand",08/04/2026,fulltime,associate,Sales,"**Company Description**
**About Grab and Our Workplace**
 Grab is Southeast Asia's leading superapp. From getting your favourite meals delivered to helping you manage your finances and getting around town hassle\-free, we've got your back with everything. In Grab, purpose gives us joy and habits build excellence, while harnessing the power of Technology and AI to deliver the mission of driving Southeast Asia forward by economically empowering everyone, with heart, hunger, honour, and humility.
   

  

**Job Description**
**Get to Know the Team**
 GrabAds allows advertisers, agencies, and merchants to engage the Grab audience through online and offline advertising experiences. Through our unique ecosystem and transacting user base, our clients can reach their desired audiences at scale, while driving measurable outcomes.
   

  

 We would like you to join us on our journey to create value for our users, drivers, merchants, and advertising partners, while continuing to make everyday lives better across Southeast Asia.
   

  

**Get to Know the Role**
 As part of the GrabAds Thailand team, you will manage a portfolio of GrabAds campaigns, working with leading advertisers directly and media agencies. You will collaborate with your team and aim to meet quarterly performance targets.
   

  

 You will work with the Ad Ops team, Key Account Manager, Demand Planning and Marketing team to achieve campaign KPIs, recommend optimized campaign flows, and identify opportunities for upselling and cross\-selling GrabAds solutions. Your goal is to grow your portfolio by building long\-term client relationships and providing a positive customer experience. You will report to Manager, Account Management (GrabAds), on site working base in Bangkok office.
   

  

**The Critical Tasks You Will Perform**
* Manage a portfolio and revenue of accounts to hit the team sales target.
* Be the main contact for clients to provide professional consultation and to coordinate on day\-today basis for campaign implementation
* Submit campaign bookings to the Ad Ops team to launch campaigns within the timeline.
* Work closely with Key Account Manager and Demand Planning team to ensure achieving GMV growth on your responsible advertisers
