 The Sales Associate Director will be guided by the APAC Sales Lead to set the sales strategy for their remit, but ultimately the expectation is for the Sales Associate Director to have autonomy to develop business in their designated region and client base. Core responsibilities of the role include:
   

  

* Development and execution of a sales strategy
