* Collaborate with broader internal stakeholders (Account Managers, Commercial Leads, wider business partners) to realize synergies between Tax Solutions and the broader S\&P Global product set.
* Building a pipeline, developing proposals, structuring agreements and managing relationships.
* Be entrepreneurial \-\- stay current with industry news to develop initiatives and attract prospects.


