 Provide solution area domain expertise and thought leadership to understand and address high\-priority business challenges. Lead end\-to\-end process mapping and the customer value journey, owning the transformation roadmap for SAP Finance and Spend Management.
   

  

**Pipeline \& Opportunity Management:** 
 Identify and develop new business opportunities within existing accounts, contributing to pipeline growth and revenue targets.
   

  

