**Requirements**
 In one of our professional roles, you’ll focus on winning with consumers and the market, while putting safety, mutual respect, and human dignity at the center. To succeed in this role, you will need the following qualifications:
   

  

* This position requires a minimum of 2 years’ experience working in FMCG industry
* Bilingual in English and Vietnamese as this role will be facing off to Vietnamese clients and customers
* Exposure using MS Office (word, excel, ppt)
* Good communication skills (both oral and writing)
* Solid negotiation skills
