 Advise Board members and Function Heads with the executive presence to manage competing regional interests. As a direct extension of the Senior Marketing Manager, you will serve as their primary surrogate—leading high\-level forums and board discussions independently when required. You will own regional internal communications and drive the strategic ""heavy lifting"" for cross\-border initiatives to ensure continuity in the Senior Marketing Manager’s absence.
