li-4399014039,AI Pursuit Strategic Account Manager,Arista Networks,"Singapore, Singapore",10/04/2026,fulltime,mid-senior level,Information Technology,"Arista Networks is an industry leader in data\-driven, client\-to\-cloud networking for large data center, campus and routing environments. What sets us apart is our relentless pursuit of innovation. We leverage the latest advancements in cloud computing, artificial intelligence, and software\-defined networking to provide our clients with a competitive edge in an increasingly interconnected world. Our solutions are designed to not only meet the current demands of the digital landscape but to also anticipate and adapt to future challenges.
   

  





