**Job Description**

**Who You'll Work With**




 As a team member of the Arista Sales team, you are the face of Arista to our customers; their internal champion for the problems they need to solve. As their champion you will align Arista’s technical resources to achieve your customer’s business outcome. You’ll partner with some of the most skilled Customer Engineers in the industry in addition to Professional Services and our Executive teams to help them understand how to execute on your customer’s behalf. Our sales teams have a culture of team success, where you’ll collaborate and be supported by like minded sales professionals. This role typically reports to a Regional Sales Manager or Area VP of Sales.
   

  





**What You'll Do**




 As an AI Pursuit Strategic Account Manager, you will be a senior consultative ""Market Maker"" driving architectural displacement and enterprise level growth across the region's largest strategic customers. You will lead the charge in adopting next\-generation AI infrastructure, specifically targeting Neocloud (GPUaaS) providers and Sovereign AI initiatives. This role operates at the growth\-focused frontier of AI, requiring a deep grasp of the GPU\-Compute\-Storage triad and a proven ability to close complex, high\-value infrastructure deals.
   

  





 Job Responsibilities:
   

  




* Drive AI Infrastructure Growth: Exceed measurable sales objectives and expand the brand within a named list of major accounts, with a focus on high\-scale AI projects.
