* EM \& Global IT


**Knowledge, Skills And Abilities**
* Strong understanding of retail and wholesale performance metrics (sell\-in, sell\-out, sell\-through, availability, margin)
* Proven ability to build and manage forecasts, plans and scenarios
* Strong analytical and problem\-solving skills with a commercial mindset
* Ability to turn data into clear, actionable insight
* High proficiency in Excel and business intelligence tools (e.g. Power BI, MicroStrategy or similar)
* Strong communication skills, able to present analysis clearly to non\-technical stakeholders
* Structured, detail\-oriented and comfortable working in a fast\-paced regional environment
* Fluent English
