**Requisite Education And Experience / Minimum Qualifications**
* University degree preferred
* 3–6 years of experience in sales planning, business analytics, retail/wholesale planning or commercial roles
* Strong experience working with sell\-in, sell\-out and performance data
* Experience in sportswear, fashion, footwear or FMCG preferred


