li-4398790650,Channel Sales Director,SoftwareOne,"Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam",,fulltime,director,Information Technology,"Are you experienced in building high‑impact partner ecosystems and driving growth through indirect sales?
 





 As Channel Sales Director, you will lead the country channel strategy, develop strategic partnerships, and drive sustainable revenue through our partner network.
 




  
 




 You will work closely with sales, marketing, and product teams to ensure strong alignment between channel initiatives and overall business goals.
 




  
 




**What you’ll be responsible for** 






 Define and execute the country channel sales strategy aligned with business growth objectives
 





 Identify, onboard, and develop strategic channel partners to expand market reach
 





 Build and maintain strong, long‑term relationships with key partners, acting as a trusted point of contact
 





 Drive revenue growth through clear targets, joint selling initiatives, and partner enablement
 





 Monitor channel performance and provide insights and recommendations to senior stakeholders
 





 Collaborate closely with direct sales teams to ensure alignment and avoid channel conflict
 



**Job Requirements** 


 Strong experience developing and managing channel or partner programs
 





 Proven ability to drive revenue through indirect or partner‑led sales models
 





 Solid understanding of partner ecosystems and B2B sales processes
 





 Excellent stakeholder management, communication, and negotiation skills
 





 Analytical mindset with the ability to use data to guide strategy and decisions
 





 Comfortable working cross‑functionally with sales, marketing, and product teams
 





 Proven experience working with cloud hyperscalers (e.g., AWS, Azure, GCP) and integrating partner solutions within their ecosystems.
 



**Company description** 





  
 




 SoftwareOne and Crayon have come together to form a global, AI\-powered software and cloud solutions provider with a bold vision for the future. With a footprint in over 70 countries and a diverse team of 13,000\+ professionals, we offer unparalleled opportunities for talent to grow, make an impact, and shape the future of technology. At the heart of our business is our people. We empower our teams to work across borders, innovate fearlessly, and continuously develop their skills through world\-class learning and development programs. Whether you're passionate about cloud, software, data, AI, or building meaningful client relationships, you’ll find a place to thrive here. Join us and be part of a purpose\-driven culture where your ideas matter, your growth is supported, and your career can go global.",IT Services and IT Consulting,Vietnam,Full-time,Director,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,1,0
li-4384444832,CS Manager,Paula's Choice Vietnam,,,fulltime,director,Business Development and Customer Service,"**Customer Service Manager** 




**Reports To:** 
 Head of Ecom \& DTC
 



**About Us:** 




 Founded in the US (Seattle) in 1995 by Paula Begoun, Paula’s Choice Skincare is a multinational brand that is now 29 years strong! Our vision is to empower consumers with in\-depth knowledge and enable people around the world to make the best choices for their skin. We question ingredients, follow the facts and stand up for the customer, because we believe that Beauty Begins with Truth.
 



**About Our Culture:** 




 We’re a rapidly growing entrepreneurial team that thrives on change, prioritizing a culture of feedback and inclusivity. We adopted an agile way of working and thrive on change. Agile lives and breathes in our full organization, this makes us move fast and grow even faster. We are proud to consistently show high double\-digit growth. Our main business is direct to consumers via our e\-commerce business making us a fast\-paced profitable organization.
 



 Paula’s Choice is also committed to diversity! Our customers come from all walks of life and so do we. We hire great people from a wide variety of backgrounds, not just because it’s the right thing to do, but because it makes our company stronger. We hope you agree. If you share our values and our enthusiasm for empowering people to achieve their own definition of beautiful, Paula’s Choice could be a wonderful fit for you.
 



**Why are we looking for you?** 




 We are seeking a Senior Digital to lead and execute our digital marketing strategies, enhance online brand presence, and drive customer engagement. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in digital marketing, e\-commerce, and performance optimization within the beauty or cosmetic industry.
 



**Responsibilities/Essential Job Functions** 



* Lead and develop the overall Customer Service strategy aligned with PCVN Business objectives
* Build and manage a high\-performing Customer Service
* Define clear OKRs and performance standards for service quality, efficiency, and sales contribution.
* Drive revenue contribution from chat consultation by improving chat\-to\-order conversion rate.
* Design consultation frameworks, sales scripts, and product recommendation strategies
* Collaborate with Ecom Key Account, Digital, Marketing teams to support major sales campaigns and product launches.
* Ensure a seamless and consistent customer experience across all touchpoints including Shopee, TikTok Shop, Lazada, Website, Social Platform, Email, Hotline, Livestream….
* Monitor and optimize key metrics such as:
* Customer Satisfaction (CSAT)
* Response Time
* Resolution Rate
* Chat Conversion Rate
* Handle escalated cases and sensitive customer situations when necessary.
* Develop and continuously improve customer service SOPs and workflows.
* Identify customer insights and recurring issues to inform improvements in product communication, content, and operations.
* Manage CRM and loyalty programs to enhance customer engagement
* 
